OL,3,GNEWSAFraudsters jailed for #279,000
OL,4,Amedical supplies con
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former NHS worker who stole medical
OL,7,Fsupplies from a hospital and sold them
OL,8,Fback to the same trust in a #279,000
OL,9,Fcon has been jailed for eight years.
OL,11,FEmmanuel Nbanga, 46, from Smith's Wood,
OL,12,FSolihull, had been found guilty of
OL,13,Ffraud by abuse of position and
OL,14,Ffraudulent trading.
OL,16,FHe had stolen supplies from Alexandra
OL,17,FHospital, Redditch, for Ultimate
OL,18,FMedical (UK) Ltd to sell back - in some
OL,19,Fcases repeatedly - to Worcestershire
OL,20,FAcute Hospitals NHS Trust.
