OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring a Worcester Crown Court hearing
OL,7,Fon Friday, company owner Solomon
OL,8,FAdeyemi, 57, from Birmingham, was also
OL,9,Fjailed for seven years for fraudulent
OL,10,Ftrading.
